OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity's subject areas ranked
OL,4,Afifth in guide
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe University of Wolverhampton has
OL,7,Fachieved its highest ever position in
OL,8,Fthe Guardian University Guide, rising
OL,9,F41 places to 67th.
OL,11,FIt also saw three subject areas -
OL,12,Feducation, business and management and
OL,13,Fgraphic design - ranked fifth in the
OL,14,F2027 guide, while criminology was
OL,15,Franked 10th.
OL,17,FProf Ebrahim Adia, vice-chancellor of
OL,18,Fthe University, called the recognition
OL,19,Fa "significant milestone."
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
